{"id": "97110011", "name": "פרמטרים לגזירות בנקודת התפר – ax³+b ו-m/x", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נתונה הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)=\\begin{cases} a x^3+b, & x\\le {{CT:0}} \\\\ {{CT:1}}, & x\\gt {{CT:0}} \\end{cases} \\]</p><p>מצאו את ערכי הפרמטרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span> שעבורם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> גזירה בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_0={{CT:0}}\\)</span>. רשמו שברים מדויקים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(a=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p>ו-</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(b=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> פונקציה גזירה בנקודה רציפה בה, ולכן בודקים קודם רציפות (משוואה אחת), ואחר כך משווים את הנגזרות החד-צדדיות לפי ההגדרה (משוואה שנייה).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — רציפות</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f({{CT:0}})={{CT:2}}a+b\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lim_{x\\to {{CT:0}}^+}f(x)={{CT:3}}\\)</span>. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f\\)</span> רציפה ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> אם ורק אם<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}a+b={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הנגזרות החד-צדדיות</b><br>בהנחה שהתנאי מתקיים, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f({{CT:0}})={{CT:2}}a+b={{CT:3}}\\)</span>. משמאל:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'_-({{CT:0}})=\\lim_{h\\to 0^-}\\frac{a({{CT:0}}+h)^3+b-({{CT:2}}a+b)}{h}=\\lim_{h\\to 0^-}a\\left({{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}h+h^2\\right)={{CT:4}}a \\]</p>ומימין:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'_+({{CT:0}})=\\lim_{h\\to 0^+}\\frac{1}{h}\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{ {{CT:0}}+h}-\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{ {{CT:0}} }\\right)=\\lim_{h\\to 0^+}\\frac{ {{CT:7}} }{ {{CT:0}}\\left({{CT:0}}+h\\right)}={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — פתרון המשוואות</b><br>משוויון הנגזרות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}a={{CT:8}}\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a={{CT:9}}\\)</span>. ממשוואת הרציפות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b={{CT:3}}-{{CT:2}}a={{CT:3}}-\\left({{CT:10}}\\right)={{CT:11}}\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a={{CT:9}},\\qquad b={{CT:11}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "-ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>בדקו את הסימן: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{x}\\right)'=-\\frac{ {{CT:6}} }{x^2}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "3*ta1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>שכחתם את המקדם 3: הנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a x^3\\)</span> היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(3a x^2\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "ta2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "mm/c+ta1*c^3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": "<p>הערך מתאים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> עם סימן הפוך. מצאו קודם את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> הנכון, ואז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b={{CT:3}}-{{CT:2}}a\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "mm/c-3*ta1*c^3", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-T", "feedback": "<p>הערך מתאים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> בלי המקדם 3 בנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a x^3\\)</span>. מצאו קודם את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> הנכון, ואז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b={{CT:3}}-{{CT:2}}a\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["c", "mm", "ta1", "ta2"], "nvariants": 48}